    "title": "PREP GOLF: East's Cole, Central's Beach fourth in Douglas",
    "text": "CHEYENNE – Cheyenne East junior Abe Cole and Cheyenne Central sophomore Bella Beach both are fourth after the first round of the season-opening Douglas Invitational on Wednesday.\nCole fired a 75 to sit fourth in the boys field. East senior Bryce Bell is in a two-way tie for sixth (77), while Devon Burbank is tied for eighth (78).",
